3. Restrictions on Distribution
-------------------------------

3.1 Non-Commercial Users SHALL NOT distribute, publish, sublicense,
    sell, rent, lease, transfer, or otherwise make available the
    Software or any Modifications to any third party.

3.2 As a limited exception to Section 3.1, Non-Commercial Users may
    fork the official VenusFactory repository and publish Modifications
    in such forks on the same version-control platform (e.g., GitHub)
    on which the official repository is hosted, provided that:
      (a) the fork retains this License and all copyright and
          attribution notices;
      (b) Modifications are clearly marked as such; and
      (c) the fork is not used for, and does not enable, any
          Commercial Use.

3.3 Nothing in this License permits the redistribution of the Software
    or any Modifications through package registries, model hubs, app
    stores, container registries, web services, or any channel
    intended to facilitate use by third parties outside Section 3.2.


